        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carl Boese, Franco Zeffirelli, Aud Egede-Nissen, Karl Falkenberg, Otto Gebühr\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer, opera director, television director\n- Works: Ships and People\n- Topics: German silent film, Italian film and opera\n\nFacts:\n- Carl Boese was born on 26 August 1887 and died on 6 July 1958.\n- Carl Boese was a German film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Ships and People is a 1920 German silent film.\n- Ships and People was directed by Carl Boese.\n- Ships and People starred Aud Egede-Nissen, Karl Falkenberg, and Otto Gebühr.\n- Franco Zeffirelli was born on 12 February 1923.\n- Franco Zeffirelli was an Italian director and producer of operas, films, and television.",
